<Layout title="WMRS DLC & expansions"><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href={href()}>Command center</a><span>/</span>Expansions</nav><div class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">EXPANSION INTELLIGENCE</p><h1>DLC & expansions</h1><p>The production Steam DLC catalog is empty in this audited base-game snapshot. Unreleased expansion assets and development-only content are excluded from this wiki.</p></div><section class="panel prose"><h2>How released expansions will appear</h2><p>Each approved expansion will get its own hub, campaign directory, cards, pack relationships and compatibility notes. New extraction candidates stay outside the deployment dataset until reviewed.</p><p>Optional depot content is gated by ownership, installation and activation in the game. An expansion card will not be described as a base-game reward.</p><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5006180/Warmachine_RogueScout/">Check the official Steam page ↗</a></section></Layout>
